11
00:01:33,810 --> 00:01:36,690
[SPEAKER_02] Pa ja sam došao u zajednicu na nagovor jedne prijateljice,

12
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:40,170
[SPEAKER_02] pozdrav Vinka. I,

13
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:43,530
[SPEAKER_02] evo, od tad mi se život okrenuo.

14
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:44,250
[SPEAKER_01] Kad je to bilo, ono?

15
00:01:45,390 --> 00:01:52,350
